most certainly most

00:51:27.370 --> 00:51:31.000
of last century's technology.

00:51:31.000 --> 00:51:33.550
Come on, look-- in statistics,
it's called regression.

00:51:33.550 --> 00:51:36.670
Don't make fun of it because
regression models are really

00:51:36.670 --> 00:51:38.290
widely used and perfectly good.

00:51:38.290 --> 00:51:39.880
It's the basis.

00:51:39.880 --> 00:51:41.500
I mean, it gets
fancier and stuff.

00:51:41.500 --> 00:51:45.340
It's the basis of the
actual control that's used,

00:51:45.340 --> 00:51:47.890
which is not, of
course, RL if any of you

00:51:47.890 --> 00:51:49.570
